=== WHD BT bring-up intermittency — root-characterized as a per-boot ALTERNATION (2026-06-20) ===
All on build_whd_soak (btc_mode coex fix in). Each trial: SWD reset, boot, BLE scan.

## Discharge-timing candidate (WLAN_CBUCK_DISCHARGE_MS 10 -> 50 ms): RULED OUT
   baseline 10ms: 5/8 discoverable (T,F,T,T,T,F,T,F)
   fix    50ms: 4/8 discoverable (F,T,F,T,F,T,F,T)  -> no improvement

## BT-only, WiFi autoconnect OFF (radio up, no association): 0/8 discoverable
   => WHD-mode BT RF REQUIRES WiFi to be ASSOCIATED. With WiFi idle, BT never
      advertises detectably (HCI/bt_enable still succeed). A real coex-ordering
      dependency: the WiFi firmware sets up the shared RF/coex path at assoc.

## WiFi-connect-gated BT start (wait for NET_EVENT_WIFI_CONNECT_RESULT +2s): RULED OUT
   4/8 (F,T,F,T,F,T,F,T) with host-reset; 4/8 (F,T,F,T,F,T,F,T) WITHOUT host-reset
   => gating BT on WiFi assoc does NOT fix it. Not an ordering/timing race.

## KEY FINDING: deterministic PER-BOOT ALTERNATION
   BT is discoverable on every OTHER SWD reset (perfect F,T,F,T,... across
   consecutive boots), ~50%, INDEPENDENT of: the per-trial host bluetoothctl
   reset (same with HOST_RESET=0), the discharge time (10 or 50 ms), and the
   WiFi-gate. When BT IS up it is HEALTHY (-70 to -73 dBm) and sustains 593
   notif/60s under load (separate PASS artifact).
   => A CYW43 BT-core state that TOGGLES across SWD reset and is NOT cleared by
      the AIROC firmware WL_REG_ON power-cycle (low/10ms or 50ms/high). Likely
      needs a true/longer cold power-cycle to clear, OR exploit the determinism
      with a harness reset-until-BT-discoverable (the next boot always flips to
      working) to make the soak/2h gate reliable.

## UPDATE: WL_REG_ON discharge 200 ms — STILL alternates (4/8, T,F,T,F,T,F,T,F)
The toggling BT-core state survives a full 200 ms WL_REG_ON power-off, so discharge
timing is CONCLUSIVELY ruled out and the toggle is deeper than chip power-down.
=> Root fix likely needs a true USB power-cycle test (operator) to confirm whether
   even that breaks it. Practical unblock = harness reset-until-BT-discoverable
   (deterministic alternation => at most 1 extra reset to land in the working state).
